WEBVTT

00:14.660 --> 00:17.570
<i>August 9th: Sunny. </i>

00:14.660 --> 00:14.700
Month

00:14.660 --> 00:14.700
Day

00:14.660 --> 00:14.700
Weather

00:17.570 --> 00:21.330
<i>Today, I learned for the first time what the sea is.</i>

00:22.210 --> 00:24.060
<i>The sea is blue.</i>

00:24.060 --> 00:26.230
<i>It's huge!</i>

00:26.230 --> 00:28.340
<i>I really want to go there someday.</i>

00:28.340 --> 00:31.260
<i>Together with Keiichiro-san, of course.</i>

00:31.640 --> 00:33.830
<i>I'll try my best to swim.</i>

00:33.830 --> 00:36.340
<i>I'm sure Keiichiro-san will praise me. </i>

00:37.730 --> 00:39.430
<i>I can't wait! </i>

00:45.600 --> 00:47.190
Hey, Flower!

01:01.200 --> 01:01.240
Half-Broken     Music Box

01:37.000 --> 01:39.230
Who left that thing here?

