02:15.490 --> 02:16.970
This is no good.

02:16.970 --> 02:19.850
It's too old for the manufacturer to still have parts.

02:19.850 --> 02:20.700
I see.

02:20.700 --> 02:20.740
General

02:20.700 --> 02:20.740
Oversize

02:20.700 --> 02:20.740
Other

02:20.700 --> 02:20.740
Oversize Garbage Disposal Payment Sticker

02:20.700 --> 02:20.740
Suginami District

02:20.700 --> 02:20.740
Signature

02:21.060 --> 02:23.290
Here, take this. It's a garbage sticker for Parents.

02:27.200 --> 02:28.460
Hey, wait!

02:28.460 --> 02:30.920
200 yen for the sticker.

03:02.200 --> 03:03.210
Huh?

03:04.040 --> 03:05.910
Where am I?

03:18.210 --> 03:19.860
It's morning.

03:37.230 --> 03:38.280
You...

03:39.610 --> 03:41.430
It'll be ready soon.

03:41.430 --> 03:42.610
Please have a seat.

03:47.950 --> 03:51.120
Really? In a trash pile?

03:51.570 --> 03:55.330
I'm inexperienced, but please treat me well!

03:55.330 --> 03:58.460
You don't remember anything
about your previous owner?

03:58.460 --> 03:59.550
No.

04:00.310 --> 04:03.220
Um, what's my name?

04:17.980 --> 04:19.900
How about this?

04:17.980 --> 04:19.900
Flower

04:23.320 --> 04:25.570
Don't tell me you can't read it.

04:26.420 --> 04:28.150
Okay then...

04:37.820 --> 04:39.980
I'm Flower, right?

04:39.980 --> 04:41.280
You're slow!

04:41.280 --> 04:42.510
What about you?

04:44.430 --> 04:45.430
Keiichiro.

04:46.000 --> 04:47.710
Keiichiro-san.

04:50.100 --> 04:53.170
Please eat, Keiichiro-san.

05:12.550 --> 05:14.330
It's spicy!

05:16.960 --> 05:18.500
Huh?

05:20.540 --> 05:23.150
<i>July 14th: Sunny.</i>

05:23.150 --> 05:26.970
<i>Starting today, I'm part of Keiichiro-san's family. </i>

05:36.310 --> 05:37.650
Discontinued

05:41.450 --> 05:43.570
She's tone-deaf.

05:45.030 --> 05:49.200
<i>Keiichiro-san seems to be living all alone. </i>

05:49.730 --> 05:51.030
<i>Is he a student?</i>

05:51.030 --> 05:53.220
<i>I wonder if it's summer break.</i>

05:56.790 --> 05:58.480
Wow!

05:59.500 --> 06:02.430
H–Hey! You don't need to clean in here!

06:02.430 --> 06:03.510
Okay!

06:07.890 --> 06:10.260
There sure is a lot of dust.

06:13.680 --> 06:15.890
I wonder what this is.

06:17.320 --> 06:19.970
I–It cried!

06:19.970 --> 06:22.310
It didn't cry. It reverberated.

06:22.770 --> 06:24.750
It's an instrument called a guitar.

06:24.750 --> 06:26.510
You connect it to that amp to play it.

06:26.510 --> 06:28.760
An instrument? You mean for music?

06:28.760 --> 06:29.370
Yeah.

06:29.370 --> 06:31.290
Oh yeah?

06:31.290 --> 06:33.950
So, you like music!

06:36.200 --> 06:37.850
Please sing!

06:39.660 --> 06:42.130
I'll sing along with you.

06:46.980 --> 06:48.750
Why don't we go for a walk?

06:48.750 --> 06:49.700
Come on.

06:53.500 --> 06:54.590
Huh?

06:55.500 --> 06:58.810
I wonder if I said something wrong.

06:59.350 --> 07:01.950
Hurry up, or I'll leave without you!

07:01.950 --> 07:03.150
Okay!

07:12.780 --> 07:15.450
It's a lovely city, isn't it?

07:19.620 --> 07:23.080
Medicine

07:21.180 --> 07:23.540
Good afternoon, Mr. Frog.

07:25.750 --> 07:27.460
She's really embarrassing.

07:27.460 --> 07:29.380
Fruits

07:27.460 --> 07:29.380
Yotsuba  Produce

07:27.460 --> 07:29.380
Vegetables

07:28.080 --> 07:29.380
Welcome!

07:29.870 --> 07:31.430
All right, try it.

07:32.410 --> 07:33.540
Okay.

07:34.770 --> 07:36.640
H–How much is it?

07:36.640 --> 07:38.350
It's 315 yen.

07:38.350 --> 07:40.350
Um... th–three hundred...

07:40.350 --> 07:43.640
That's an awfully old Parents.

07:43.640 --> 07:45.060
You okay with that?

07:45.060 --> 07:47.880
Well, I guess I just couldn't leave her alone.

07:47.880 --> 07:48.790
Welcome!

07:49.340 --> 07:50.570
Tomato and cucumber.

07:50.570 --> 07:53.740
420 yen. The change is 580 yen, correct?

07:53.740 --> 07:56.690
That's right. Good job.

07:53.740 --> 07:54.820
Yaoya

07:57.240 --> 07:57.910
Thanks.

08:04.730 --> 08:06.830
I'll teach you, so give that to me.

08:07.630 --> 08:09.340
You see, this money is—

08:09.340 --> 08:10.420
U–Um!

08:11.240 --> 08:15.750
I'll try my best, so... um...

08:15.750 --> 08:17.680
Don't worry. I won't throw you away.

08:19.480 --> 08:20.770
Okay!

08:20.770 --> 08:23.600
I'll try my best to be useful!

08:31.720 --> 08:34.450
So, this again for dinner?

08:35.570 --> 08:38.630
I mean, we ate the same thing this morning!

08:38.630 --> 08:39.740
I'm sorry.

08:40.300 --> 08:43.080
My memory functions are kinda bad.

08:51.260 --> 08:53.880
<i>He's fed up with me, isn't he?</i>

08:53.880 --> 08:56.300
Harada Stationery

09:11.390 --> 09:14.400
So, you found her in the trash at the shrine?

09:14.400 --> 09:16.280
There really are some cruel people out there.

09:16.280 --> 09:20.240
Well, I didn't expect her to start working again.

09:20.650 --> 09:24.910
Oh yes, if you'd like, take this.

09:27.080 --> 09:29.000
Summer Break Radio Exercise Stamp Card

09:27.080 --> 09:29.000
Radio Exercises

09:27.080 --> 09:29.000
Name

09:27.560 --> 09:29.000
Radio exercises?

09:29.000 --> 09:31.090
I'm in charge of it this year.

09:31.090 --> 09:34.300
It'll be livelier and more fun
with more participants, right?

09:35.510 --> 09:36.720
Uh, sure...

09:38.380 --> 09:39.500
Let's go, Flower.

09:39.500 --> 09:40.360
Okay.

09:40.360 --> 09:41.570
Here.

09:41.570 --> 09:43.170
What's this?

09:44.490 --> 09:50.360
<i>Since I'm bad at remembering things,
Keiichiro-san bought me something great.</i>

09:53.070 --> 09:53.190
Picture Diary

09:54.150 --> 09:58.280
Write down what you do every day
so that you won't forget.

09:58.290 --> 09:59.160
Okay!

10:01.230 --> 10:03.620
<i>With this, there's nothing to worry about.</i>

10:06.540 --> 10:08.430
<i>I made some friends too.  </i>

