10:08.430 --> 10:09.820
<i>Summer is fantastic!</i>

10:09.820 --> 10:10.460
<i>Fun!</i>

10:11.160 --> 10:12.670
One...

10:11.170 --> 10:12.670
Face forward!

10:13.000 --> 10:15.170
Two...

10:13.660 --> 10:15.180
Okay, the other way.

10:15.800 --> 10:17.180
Flower!

10:17.180 --> 10:19.090
Not like that. Like this.

10:19.090 --> 10:20.260
L–Like this?

10:20.640 --> 10:23.140
Point the tips of your hands!

10:20.890 --> 10:22.260
Yeah, yeah!

10:22.260 --> 10:23.930
You're doing good!

10:23.140 --> 10:23.930
Like this!

10:27.770 --> 10:31.440
Oh, you live with that weird guy?

10:31.440 --> 10:32.650
What weird guy?

10:33.020 --> 10:35.230
You know, near Sacchan's place.

10:35.230 --> 10:36.990
The guy who's always hanging around.

10:37.000 --> 10:39.030
Keiichiro-san's not weird!

10:39.030 --> 10:40.370
But you know—

10:40.360 --> 10:42.620
She's right. You shouldn't say that.

10:43.070 --> 10:45.490
He's been through a lot, you know.

10:51.170 --> 10:53.840
Congratulations
Entrance Ceremony

10:51.170 --> 10:53.840
Moesugi
University
Middle School

10:57.050 --> 10:59.550
Who are those people?

11:00.910 --> 11:02.670
My family.

11:02.680 --> 11:04.640
They used to live here with me.

11:04.640 --> 11:06.130
I see.

11:06.130 --> 11:08.370
Why aren't they still here?

11:08.370 --> 11:09.850
Did they go somewhere?

11:12.780 --> 11:14.020
They became gods.

11:15.570 --> 11:18.490
<i>To think he used to live with gods... </i>

11:18.490 --> 11:20.110
<i>That's amazing!</i>

11:20.110 --> 11:22.740
<i>Keiichiro-san is a mysterious person!</i>

11:33.420 --> 11:33.500
Junk

11:40.050 --> 11:42.270
Is something wrong, Keiichiro-san?

11:42.270 --> 11:44.000
No, not really.

11:45.700 --> 11:49.520
<i>He's very kind to me.</i>

11:49.520 --> 11:53.100
<i>I'm really happy to be living here!</i>

12:09.250 --> 12:11.450
What's this?

12:10.200 --> 12:11.460
Hey!

12:11.460 --> 12:13.260
We're going now.

12:14.290 --> 12:15.460
Coming!

12:21.300 --> 12:23.340
<i>July 19th: Sunny.</i>

12:24.060 --> 12:27.810
<i>The two of us went to the town's big bath house.</i>

12:33.940 --> 12:36.020
On second thought, I will wash your back!

12:36.600 --> 12:38.770
I–Idiot! You—

12:43.320 --> 12:46.700
<i>July 22nd: My first time running an errand by myself.</i>

12:50.740 --> 12:54.090
<i>I beat Keiichiro-san at spitting watermelon seeds.</i>

12:57.080 --> 13:01.550
<i>July 25th: Bicycle practice by the river. Fun!</i>

13:03.920 --> 13:07.470
<i>July 29th: Today was also sunny. Fun!</i>

13:10.080 --> 13:13.390
<i>July 31st: Fun!</i>

13:16.160 --> 13:18.760
<i>August 5th: Fun!</i>

13:19.310 --> 13:24.260
<i>I'm gaining so many memories,
thanks to Keiichiro-san.</i>

13:24.240 --> 13:24.280
Candy-coated Fruit

13:24.240 --> 13:24.280
Best Pork Pancakes

13:24.990 --> 13:28.410
<i>August 9th: Today was a festival! </i>

13:28.410 --> 13:30.200
<i>There were so many people in town! </i>

13:28.740 --> 13:28.870
Yakisoba

13:28.870 --> 13:28.990
Shaved
Ice

13:30.200 --> 13:31.850
<i>It was really crowded! </i>

13:35.820 --> 13:37.310
What's that?

13:37.310 --> 13:38.880
A prayer.

13:38.880 --> 13:41.780
When you want to make a wish to the gods,
this is how you do it.

13:41.800 --> 13:42.960
I see.

13:44.920 --> 13:50.640
<i>A wish, huh? Humans must
be close friends with the gods. </i>

13:47.340 --> 13:49.760
Takoyaki

13:50.650 --> 13:57.290
<i>If a Parents like me makes a wish,
will the gods still grant it?</i>

13:57.270 --> 14:01.480
Buttered Baked Potato

13:57.270 --> 14:01.480
Taiyaki

13:57.270 --> 14:01.480
Specially

13:57.270 --> 14:01.480
made

13:58.690 --> 14:00.310
Keiichiro-san.

14:00.310 --> 14:01.480
You still want more to eat?

14:03.730 --> 14:05.780
Um, what's this?

14:08.990 --> 14:10.030
Keiichiro!

14:10.030 --> 14:12.120
Do you know him?

14:13.080 --> 14:14.950
Yeah, I guess.

14:14.950 --> 14:18.040
A Parents? What's gotten into you?

14:20.550 --> 14:21.440
Um...

14:21.440 --> 14:24.800
This is my first time meeting
one of Keiichiro-san's friends.

14:24.800 --> 14:28.420
Well, I don't know about a friend.
I'm more like an ex-bandmate.

14:28.420 --> 14:29.840
Band?

14:31.090 --> 14:32.000
Let's go.

14:32.630 --> 14:34.260
Keiichiro-san?

14:38.190 --> 14:39.730
Call me!

14:39.730 --> 14:42.860
If you're ever in trouble,
you can talk to me anytime!

14:47.280 --> 14:51.870
As we near the Obon Holiday, Shonan Beach
is experiencing the peak of summer!

14:51.870 --> 14:53.560
How's Shonan Beach?

14:51.870 --> 14:54.830
Peak of Summer!

14:51.870 --> 14:54.830
Direct interviews with gals in swimsuits

14:53.560 --> 14:55.790
It's great, of course.

14:57.580 --> 14:59.370
So that's the sea?

14:59.370 --> 15:01.460
It's huge!

15:32.190 --> 15:35.590
Let me see the real sea someday.

15:36.200 --> 15:38.520
I beg of you, gods!

15:57.510 --> 16:00.020
<i>August 12th: Sunny.</i>

16:00.020 --> 16:02.190
<i>I went to a fireworks festival with Keiichiro-san. </i>

16:02.760 --> 16:04.810
Tamaya!

16:04.810 --> 16:07.230
Tamaya? What's that?

16:07.240 --> 16:08.320
Dunno.

16:09.160 --> 16:11.380
<i>Summer still continues,</i>

16:09.690 --> 16:11.380
Tamaya!

16:11.380 --> 16:13.200
<i>and lots of fun things too. </i>

16:13.860 --> 16:17.620
<i>But I happened to notice...</i>

16:17.620 --> 16:22.040
<i>Keiichiro-san looks lonely
every now and then for some reason.</i>

16:26.250 --> 16:28.380
I'm going out for a bit.

16:28.380 --> 16:30.530
Can you look after the house by yourself?

16:30.530 --> 16:31.460
I'll go too!

16:31.460 --> 16:32.920
No, you can't.

16:33.800 --> 16:35.340
But...

16:35.340 --> 16:37.640
I want to go by myself.

16:51.320 --> 16:56.240
I wonder what would make
Keiichiro-san smile like that.

16:59.310 --> 17:01.540
Please tell me, gods.

17:15.300 --> 17:16.800
That's it!

17:16.820 --> 17:17.790
All right!

17:43.910 --> 17:45.640
It's morning!

17:45.640 --> 17:47.080
Please wake up!

17:47.080 --> 17:49.710
What is it? Did something good happen?

17:50.740 --> 17:52.410
It's nothing!

17:53.170 --> 17:55.330
<i>August 15th: Sunny.</i>

17:55.340 --> 17:56.630
<i>I started special training today!</i>

18:02.970 --> 18:05.390
You're seriously tone-deaf.

18:05.390 --> 18:06.640
Like this.

18:12.770 --> 18:17.990
<i>After practicing secretly,
I'll let Keiichiro-san listen to my singing.</i>

18:23.910 --> 18:27.890
<i>Because Keiichiro-san loves songs.</i>

18:27.890 --> 18:30.210
<i>I'm sure he'll love it!</i>

18:37.050 --> 18:41.470
<i>August 19th: At last, I've mastered my vocals.</i>

18:45.630 --> 18:50.250
<i>August 23th: I've become quite good.</i>

18:50.250 --> 18:51.560
<i>Singing is fun!</i>

18:58.190 --> 19:01.570
<i>I wonder if Keiichiro-san
had this kind of feeling.</i>

19:06.160 --> 19:07.580
<i>It won't be long now.</i>

19:07.590 --> 19:09.660
<i>Please wait, Keiichiro-san.</i>

19:13.270 --> 19:14.500
<i>But...</i>

19:33.880 --> 19:34.920
Wait!

19:35.440 --> 19:36.770
Please wait!

19:58.080 --> 19:59.180
Huh?

19:59.880 --> 20:03.540
When did I fall asleep?

20:08.220 --> 20:10.810
This is bad! I left the laundry out!

20:12.730 --> 20:15.700
Hey, why don't you rejoin the band?

20:16.900 --> 20:19.070
I told you, that accident wasn't your fault!

20:19.670 --> 20:20.560
Don't blame yourse—

20:20.560 --> 20:21.610
I can't.

20:23.150 --> 20:29.200
Ever since that day, I can't feel anything,
no matter what songs I listen to.

20:46.710 --> 20:47.960
Flower?

20:50.760 --> 20:53.350
Welcome home, Keiichiro-san!

21:00.940 --> 21:03.800
This year, jellyfish have
appeared earlier than usual,

21:02.860 --> 21:05.780
Shocking!

21:02.860 --> 21:05.780
Large influx of jellyfish

21:03.800 --> 21:06.240
and beach season is nearing its end.

21:07.910 --> 21:09.700
We can go next year, okay?

21:10.080 --> 21:12.320
I'll definitely take you next time.

21:16.920 --> 21:18.460
I see.

21:19.290 --> 21:22.210
Since we'll be together forever, right?

21:28.240 --> 21:30.540
Um, Keiichiro-san?

21:30.540 --> 21:32.810
Will you have some free time tomorrow?

21:34.680 --> 21:36.390
Why are you suddenly being formal?

21:38.270 --> 21:39.560
Actually, I...

21:48.660 --> 21:50.200
Flower! Hey!

22:12.930 --> 22:14.140
Fun.

22:25.030 --> 22:29.450
Looking after the house alone.
Doing the laundry is fun.          But staying home alone makes me lonely.

23:05.030 --> 23:07.500
Hello? What's the matter?

23:07.500 --> 23:09.860
Oh, did you change your mind?

23:09.860 --> 23:11.360
I need a favor.

23:12.000 --> 23:12.660
Huh?

23:13.740 --> 23:16.790
Let me borrow your car.

23:33.220 --> 23:36.310
Do you see it? It's the sea, Flower.

23:50.400 --> 23:52.280
Flower, that song...

23:54.470 --> 23:56.020
I'm sorry.

23:56.020 --> 23:57.540
I secretly listened to it.

24:37.030 --> 24:39.200
It's Keiichiro-san's song!

24:40.330 --> 24:42.620
I love this song.

24:45.790 --> 24:47.040
It's a good song!

24:47.040 --> 24:49.300
Hey, why don't you play it
at your next concert?

24:49.300 --> 24:50.880
If you do, I'll come watch.

24:54.480 --> 24:56.170
It's wonderful.

24:56.170 --> 25:01.100
The fish, octopi, squids, clams, anemones,

25:01.100 --> 25:05.020
and even sea slugs
will be happy to sing along with it.

25:01.100 --> 25:01.140
Dorayaki

25:01.100 --> 25:01.140
Changing Rooms

25:01.100 --> 25:01.140
Please feel free to use the changing rooms and showers

25:01.100 --> 25:01.140
Boogie
Boards

25:01.100 --> 25:01.140
Locker Rooms
Rest Area

25:05.530 --> 25:06.980
Even sea slugs?

25:08.340 --> 25:12.690
I know quite a lot
about both you and the sea.

25:14.210 --> 25:15.610
Flower...

25:19.810 --> 25:21.150
That's why...

25:21.950 --> 25:25.160
Please let me be a part of your family.

25:26.870 --> 25:28.040
Forever.

25:37.720 --> 25:41.720
We won't be lonely if we're together.

25:58.130 --> 26:00.450
<i>August 10th: Sunny.</i>

26:00.450 --> 26:04.450
<i>Yesterday, I understood for the first time
what the sea really is.</i>

26:04.450 --> 26:07.830
<i>I kept pestering Keiichiro-san with,
"I want to go!"</i>

26:08.370 --> 26:10.750
This'll have to do for now.

26:11.250 --> 26:13.670
<i>He said and then borrowed this.</i>

26:24.270 --> 26:27.520
Some day, I promise
to take you to the real sea.

26:28.940 --> 26:30.190
Really?

26:31.670 --> 26:34.240
<i>I'll try my best to swim.</i>

26:34.240 --> 26:36.840
<i>I wonder if Keiichiro-san will praise me.</i>

26:38.070 --> 26:39.570
<i>I'm really looking forward to it!</i>

26:41.570 --> 26:45.910
<i>Our summer has only just begun! </i>

27:44.800 --> 27:47.220
<i>Will you sing with me?</i>
